 "preamble": "Phone call between Sunita (the hirer, who is paying for a job) and Ramesh (the worker, who will do it). Gawah is an AI witness listening on the call. Today is Saturday 21 November 2026. Amounts are in Indian rupees.\n\n",
 "questions": {
  "work_agreed": "Have both speakers agreed on what work is to be done (the scope of the job)? Answer yes only if one person has described the work and the other has accepted it.",
  "amount_agreed": "Have both speakers agreed on the total price for the whole job? Answer yes only if one final total amount has been accepted by both. An offer or counter-offer that the other person has not accepted is not an agreement.",
  "advance_agreed": "Have both speakers agreed on an advance payment amount (money paid before the work starts)? Answer yes only if both have accepted the same advance amount.",
  "balance_when": "Have both speakers agreed on when the remaining balance (the total minus the advance) will be paid? Answer yes only if a specific time or condition for paying the balance was stated and accepted. If the question was asked but brushed aside or not answered, answer no.",
  "dates_agreed": "Have both speakers agreed on both the start date and the finish date of the work?",
  "late_terms": "Have the speakers agreed on what happens if the work is finished late or left unfinished, such as a penalty, a deduction or a refund? A promise to finish on time is not enough; answer yes only if a consequence was agreed.",
  "addressed_gawah": "In the last line of the transcript, is the speaker talking directly to Gawah, the AI witness, for example by calling it by name?",
  "topic_left_unclear": "Is there a contract term (price, advance, when the balance is paid, or dates) that one speaker asked about, where the other speaker has already replied without giving a clear answer and moved on to a different topic? A question in the last line that the other speaker has not yet had a chance to answer does not count. Answer yes only if that term is still unsettled.",
  "conflicting_figures": "Has a figure that both speakers had already accepted (for example the total price or the advance) later been stated as a different number for that same term? Answer no for bargaining: an offer, a counter-offer, or a lower or higher number proposed before both speakers accepted is not a conflict.",
  "wrapping_up": "Is the call ending right now? Answer yes only if, in the last two lines, a speaker says goodbye, says they are hanging up, or thanks the other person to close the conversation. Agreeing to a term (for example 'theek hai', 'pakka', 'done') or promising to finish the work on time is not ending the call.",
  "moved_to_schedule": "In the last line of the transcript, is the speaker asking or talking about when the work will start, when it will be finished, or what happens if it is late or left unfinished?",
  "talking_money": "In the last line of the transcript, is the speaker talking about money: the price, the advance, the balance, or how or when a payment will be made?",
  "balance_skipped": "Have the speakers agreed on an advance and then started talking about a different subject, such as the dates of the work or what happens if it is late, without anyone saying when the remaining balance will be paid? Answer no if when the balance is paid has been agreed, if no advance has been agreed yet, or if the speakers are still talking about payments.",
  "closing_soon": "Have the speakers finished discussing the terms and started closing the conversation, for example by confirming when and where they will meet next, thanking each other, or saying goodbye? Answer no while a price, a payment, a date or any other term is still being discussed."
 },
 "updates": 33,
 "lines": {
  "1": "Sunita: Hello, Ramesh ji? Main Sunita bol rahi hoon. Sharma ji ne aapka number diya tha, painting ke liye.\n",
  "2": "Ramesh: Haan ji madam, namaste. Sharma ji ne bataya tha. Boliye, kya kaam hai?\n",
  "3": "Sunita: Mera 2BHK flat hai, Indirapuram mein. Poora flat paint karwana hai - dono bedroom, hall, kitchen, aur balcony ki grill bhi.\n",
  "4": "Ramesh: Theek hai ji. Ceiling bhi karni hai ya sirf walls?\n",
  "5": "Sunita: Ceiling bhi. Aur ek bedroom mein thodi seelan hai, wahan putty bhi lagegi.\n",
  "6": "Ramesh: Ho jayega madam. Seelan wali wall pe pehle putty aur primer, phir do coat. Paint kaunsa lagwana hai, normal emulsion ya premium wala?\n",
  "7": "Sunita: Zyada mehenga nahi chahiye, normal emulsion theek hai. Material aap laoge ya main mangwaun?\n",
  "8": "Ramesh: Material main le aaunga ji, aapko tension nahi leni. Labour aur material mila ke bata deta hoon.\n",
  "9": "Sunita: Haan to batao, total kitna lagega?\n",
  "10": "Ramesh: Dekhiye madam, 2BHK hai, putty ka kaam bhi hai... labour material sab mila ke 28 hazaar lagega.\n",
  "11": "Sunita: Arre 28 to bahut zyada hai. Pichhli baar 20 mein poora ghar hua tha.\n",
  "12": "Ramesh: Madam ab paint ka rate badh gaya hai. Chaliye aapke liye 25 kar deta hoon, isse kam nahi hoga.\n",
  "13": "Sunita: 24 final karo, aur kaam achha hona chahiye.\n",
  "14": "Ramesh: Theek hai ji, 24 hazaar final. Labour, material, putty, sab ismein.\n",
  "15": "Sunita: Done. Aur advance kitna chahiye aapko?\n",
  "16": "Ramesh: Material lana padega na madam, to 8 hazaar advance de dijiye, kaam shuru karne se pehle.\n",
  "17": "Sunita: 8 hazaar... theek hai, jis din kaam shuru karoge us din subah GPay kar dungi.\n",
  "18": "Ramesh: Ji bilkul, chalega.\n",
  "19": "Sunita: Achha ye batao, shuru kab karoge? Agle hafte mere ghar mehmaan aa rahe hain.\n",
  "20": "Ramesh: Madam is Monday se shuru kar deta hoon. Do ladke aur lagaunga saath mein.\n",
  "21": "Sunita: Aur khatam kab tak hoga?\n",
  "22": "Ramesh: Paanch din ka kaam hai ji. Monday shuru, Friday shaam tak poora finish.\n",
  "23": "Sunita: Pakka Friday? Saturday ko mehmaan aa jayenge, uske baad nahi chalega.\n",
  "24": "Ramesh: Pakka madam, Friday shaam tak. Aap befikar rahiye.\n",
  "25": "Sunita: Aur agar Friday tak nahi hua to? Pichhli baar ek contractor ne do hafte latka diya tha.\n",
  "26": "Ramesh: Aisa nahi hoga ji. Phir bhi agar late hua to har din ka 500 rupaye kaat lena aap.\n",
  "27": "Sunita: Theek hai, 500 rupaye per day. Yaad rakhna.\n",
  "28": "Ramesh: Ji madam, zubaan di hai.\n",
  "29": "Sunita: Chalo theek hai phir. Monday subah 9 baje aa jana, address main WhatsApp kar dungi.\n",
  "30": "Ramesh: Ji madam, 9 baje pahunch jaunga. Dhanyavaad.\n",
  "31": "Sunita: Theek hai Ramesh ji, to phir Monday ko milte hain. Bye.\n",
  "32": "Ramesh: Namaste madam.\n"
 },
